{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Cal, miss ya! Crazy rollercoaster week. A competing car maintenance shop snagged a deal we were trying to secure for months and it made me feel kinda bummed out. You know, I put in so much effort at work, but it feels like nothing. Am I wasting my time?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-0153af8e7d2c48059c9bc109", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.306094+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0153af8e7d2c48059c9bc109", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0153af8e7d2c48059c9bc109", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave, sorry to hear that. It can be discouraging when you feel like your hard work goes unnoticed. But don't give up, keep pushing and believe in yourself. The payoff will be worth it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-e8fbb09152c820584902f354", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.326966+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e8fbb09152c820584902f354", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e8fbb09152c820584902f354", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Calvin, thanks for the encouragement. It can be tough when you feel like your efforts are going unseen. I gotta have faith and patience. I'm sure it's only a matter of time till things work out. How do you stay motivated when faced with setbacks?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-8ac0855af659e330004eaa80", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.341219+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8ac0855af659e330004eaa80", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8ac0855af659e330004eaa80", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: When setbacks come my way, I remind myself why I'm passionate about my goals. I rely on helpful people around me and take a break to recharge with my favorite activities. That always helps me get back to feeling motivated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-21ab1d2d58c7e8b1faf224a3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.355139+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "21ab1d2d58c7e8b1faf224a3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "21ab1d2d58c7e8b1faf224a3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: That's a great approach, Cal! Reminding yourself of the passion for the goals and getting help from others is really important. Taking a break and having fun sounds so refreshing. Oh, I just got back from a music festival - it was amazing! The energy, the music, the crowd - sooo good. I felt so alive!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-ca396ea05beb9987c40ca969", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.374096+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ca396ea05beb9987c40ca969", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ca396ea05beb9987c40ca969", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow Dave, sounds awesome! Music festivals bring so much joy and the energy of the crowd can be amazing. Got any photos from the festival? I'd love to check them out and join in on the fun."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-b0c5760a6aea082d79ec4387", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.389825+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b0c5760a6aea082d79ec4387", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b0c5760a6aea082d79ec4387", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Yep! I got this awesome pic from the event. The main stage was unreal. The headliner was so good and the vibe was unreal!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-cad6e3472ac2ce9a07db0b99", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.407151+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cad6e3472ac2ce9a07db0b99", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cad6e3472ac2ce9a07db0b99", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, that looks awesome! The crowd looks really excited and the stage is incredible. Who was the headliner?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-9bbb0060936e4a9b68edbce3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.417587+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9bbb0060936e4a9b68edbce3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9bbb0060936e4a9b68edbce3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: The Fireworks headlined the festival."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-ddcc9039df40e1b9a7732b0f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.433668+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ddcc9039df40e1b9a7732b0f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ddcc9039df40e1b9a7732b0f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, I heard great things about The Fireworks! Performing with Frank Ocean recently has been really cool. Seeing them perform live must've been awesome - I bet the energy was electric! That's why I love my job so much - connecting with the crowd."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-1a7a5cdb5947d7fd07863d94", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.444777+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1a7a5cdb5947d7fd07863d94", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1a7a5cdb5947d7fd07863d94", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Yeah, Calvin! The crowd had such a buzz. Music brings people together in such an amazing way, and it's just like when I'm fixing up things. I love the feeling of taking something broken and making it whole again. That's why I keep doing what I do."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-e8b47599fe772c2b54881ad6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.457777+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e8b47599fe772c2b54881ad6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e8b47599fe772c2b54881ad6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah, Dave! Music and repairing things are so fulfilling and satisfying. Seeing something go from broken to whole is incredible. You're making a difference too - it's amazing. Keep it up, friend."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-ae39fd7a7cb6d2ed29e4cee3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.473924+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ae39fd7a7cb6d2ed29e4cee3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ae39fd7a7cb6d2ed29e4cee3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, buddy. Your support really helps. It's great to have a friend who believes in me. I'll keep pushing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-0c2b574d3926897880f594d4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.487036+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0c2b574d3926897880f594d4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0c2b574d3926897880f594d4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: I believe in you, Dave. Keep pushing and never forget how awesome you are."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-167eddc5d8a669468985b601", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.500900+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "167eddc5d8a669468985b601", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "167eddc5d8a669468985b601", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Your support means a lot. I'm gonna keep going and not forget my value!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-5442c3f92035e0d3da5579d8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.512591+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5442c3f92035e0d3da5579d8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5442c3f92035e0d3da5579d8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: C'mon, remember how great you are! Keep going for those dreams. You got this! You know what Dave? Last week, I got a new Ferrari! It's a masterpiece on wheels. Excited for thrilling rides and unforgettable journeys! Perhaps a photo of this unique beauty will lift your mood."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-65bd2f8b953a092ef074359d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.521750+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "65bd2f8b953a092ef074359d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "65bd2f8b953a092ef074359d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow! Thanks a ton for the kind words and encouragement! Your positivity is contagious. Congratulations on the new Ferrari \u2013 that's incredible! Must be one amazing ride. I'm all in for those thrilling journeys! Feel free to share a pic of your new beauty whenever you're ready. Let's keep the good vibes rolling! Take care and see you later!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-f760daba1149ed6d0d61d5ee", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.535668+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f760daba1149ed6d0d61d5ee", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f760daba1149ed6d0d61d5ee", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: The Ferrari is indeed a showstopper. I'll be sure to share a pic soon. Here's to more thrilling rides and positive vibes. Take care, and looking forward to catching up soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_23-a86e20190c6bce1f06498de3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:07:06.556080+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a86e20190c6bce1f06498de3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a86e20190c6bce1f06498de3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
